{"id":"gamefreak-director-199","kind":"blog","title":"[GameFreak部长专栏] 第199回","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2011-06-09","publication":"増田部長のめざめるパワー 第199回","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/entry-199/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_director_column","summary":"增田顺一漫步 E3，探访周边设备、赛车游戏与雅达利展台，感受新技术和行业交流带来的刺激。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","宝可梦","官方博客"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田部長のめざめるパワー 第199回","url":"https://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/dir/2011/06/index.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/dir/2011/06/index.html","type":"official_blog"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"今天也来到 E3。\n\n果然，入口处还是有坦克（笑）！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n然后……参观完主要场所之后……\n\n开始探索周边设备。其实我从很久以前就喜欢这些东西。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n哦——这种东西真想家里也有一台（笑）！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n哦哦哦！兰博基尼！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n我最喜欢的兰博基尼，居然有这么多……\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n连座椅也是！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n太棒了……真的，太厉害了！\n\n另一个地方还有穹顶形的屏幕。\n\n影像会以 180 度展开。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n这个也好厉害！\n\n发现了！三屏赛车游戏。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n啊，那边也有一台。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n哎呀，这里也有……一家一台，您觉得如何？\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n然后……\n\n找到了找到了。Vita。找到了！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n真想做点让人开心的游戏啊……\n\n1972 年创立了世界上第一家商业游戏公司的雅达利。\n\n现场还摆放着街机机台。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199l.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n鲤鱼旗♪\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199m.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n嗯——身材真魁梧。看来我是赢不了了。嗯。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n好吓人啊——。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199o.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n活动设施真厉害。好吓人。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199p.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n大量的电视机游戏。\n\n有很多值得一看的地方，也有很多值得学习的地方。\n\n让我受到了刺激。\n\n通过行业之间这样相互切磋，\n\n能够通向未来——我怀着这样的愿望，离开了今年的 E3。\n\n哎呀，游戏真是最棒的娱乐！\n\n那么，再见！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199q.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n下回再见噜！\n\n\n\n\n<details class=\"gf-director-language\"><summary>查看官方英文版</summary>\n\nGoing to E3 convention center.\n\nThere is a tank at the entrance! =)\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nAfter checking major booth,\n\nlet’s check peripheral items.\n\nStrangely, I love these staffs.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nWow, I want this for my home! =)\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nWooow! Its Lamborghini!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nThere are lots of my lovable Lamborghini…\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nSeat, too!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nSuper… It’s just incredible!\n\nIn another booth, there is a dome screen.\n\n180 degree world expands!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nThis one is cool, too.\n\nSurprising! Racing game using three monitors.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nHere’s another one.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nOh, here is another.\n\nWhy don’t you get one?\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nAnd…\n\nYes, here it is! PS Vita!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nI want to develop fun game…\n\nAtari, the world first commercial video game starter in 1972.\n\nThere are few cabinet consoles.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199l.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nFlying carp!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199m.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nWhat a macho! I’m afraid I can’t win against him.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nScary!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199o.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nEvent facilities, scary.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199p.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nTons of video games.\n\nThere a lot of point worthy of note.\n\nMany parts to study.\n\nIt was stimulating.\n\nMany companies are working hard together\n\nto bring us a new technology of future.\n\nI left E3 convention center with above thought.\n\nWell, video game is the ultimate entertainment!!\n\nSee you!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/en/199q.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nCiao!!\n\n\n</details>","markdown_ja":"今日もＥ３に。\n\nやっぱり入り口には戦車（笑）！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nそして、、、主要な場所を見学した後は、、、\n\n周辺機器を探索。意外と昔から好きなんですよ。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nおー、こんなの家に欲しい（笑）！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nおおおっ！ランボルギーニ！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n大好きなランボルギーニがこんなに。。。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nシートも！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nすっげー。。。まじ、すごい！\n\n別の場所ではドーム型スクリーンが。\n\n１８０度映像が広がります。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nこれもすごい！\n\n発見！３画面のレースゲーム。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nあ、こっちにも。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nあらら、ここにも。。。一家に一台、いかがですか？\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nそして、、、\n\nいましたいました。ヴィータ。いました！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nなんか楽しいゲーム作りたいなぁ。。。\n\n１９７２年に世界初の商業ゲーム会社を設立したアタリさん。\n\n筐体が置いてありました。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199l.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nこいのぉーぼぉーりぃ♪\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199m.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nうーん、立派な体型。勝てそうにないな、これは。うん。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nこわいよー。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199o.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nイベント設備すごい。こわい。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199p.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nたくさんのTVゲーム。\n\nみどころも沢山ありました。勉強すべきところも沢山ありました。\n\n刺激になりました。\n\nこうやって業界同士で切磋琢磨していくことで、\n\n未来につながる、そう願いつつ今年のＥ３を後にしました。\n\nいやー、ゲームって最高のエンターテインメントですね！！\n\nそれでは！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/199/ja/199q.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nチャオ！！"}}